{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/css/vh/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>프로젝트 진행 중 전체화면을 만들기 위해 100vh를 사용했다.<br>\nPC환경에서 테스트 할 때에는 문제가 없었지만, 실제 모바일 기기에서 브라우저로 접속 후 확인했더니 세로 스크롤이 생기는 버그가 있었다.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-tip\">\n<p>vh는 viewport height에 해당하는 단위로, 해당 브라우저의 높이에 따라 상대적으로 적용되는 단위다.<br>\n예를 들어, 화면의 높이가 100px이라면 1vh는 1px이 된다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"원인\" style=\"position:relative;\">원인<a href=\"#%EC%9B%90%EC%9D%B8\" aria-label=\"원인 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>모바일 브라우저에서 100vh는 하단 URL을 입력하는 공간(이 영역은 스크롤 방향에 따라 가변적)을 포함하기 때문이었다.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>모바일 브라우저에서 100vh는 하단 URL을 입력하는 공간을 포함한다.</li>\n<li>URL바는 상황에 따라 보여지거나 없어지는 경우가 있는데, 100vh는 그에 따라 다시 측정되지 않는다.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"해결\" style=\"position:relative;\">해결<a href=\"#%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0\" aria-label=\"해결 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>모바일 환경에서 100vh를 사용하기 위해서는, Javascript로 화면 세로값을 체크 후, 계산을 통해 사용 해야한다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-javascript--css로-해결\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. Javascript + CSS로 해결<a href=\"#1-javascript--css%EB%A1%9C-%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0\" aria-label=\"1 javascript  css로 해결 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<h4 id=\"1-1-javascript로-페이지-로딩-시와-resize될때-마다-화면의-높이값을-체크하여-html에---vh라는-style을-추가해준다\" style=\"position:relative;\">1-1. Javascript로, 페이지 로딩 시와 resize될때 마다 화면의 높이값을 체크하여 html에 –vh라는 style을 추가해준다.<a href=\"#1-1-javascript%EB%A1%9C-%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80-%EB%A1%9C%EB%94%A9-%EC%8B%9C%EC%99%80-resize%EB%90%A0%EB%95%8C-%EB%A7%88%EB%8B%A4-%ED%99%94%EB%A9%B4%EC%9D%98-%EB%86%92%EC%9D%B4%EA%B0%92%EC%9D%84-%EC%B2%B4%ED%81%AC%ED%95%98%EC%97%AC-html%EC%97%90---vh%EB%9D%BC%EB%8A%94-style%EC%9D%84-%EC%B6%94%EA%B0%80%ED%95%B4%EC%A4%80%EB%8B%A4\" aria-label=\"1 1 javascript로 페이지 로딩 시와 resize될때 마다 화면의 높이값을 체크하여 html에   vh라는 style을 추가해준다 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// --vh</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">setVh</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>documentElement<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>style<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">setProperty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'--vh'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span>window<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>innerHeight<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">px</span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// const vh = window.innerHeight * 0.01;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// document.documentElement.style.setProperty(\"--vh\", `${vh}px`);</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\nwindow<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">addEventListener</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'resize'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> setVh<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token function\">setVh</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>추가해 준 후 페이지에서 개발자모드로 코드를 보면 최상단 html에 style=“–vh:800px” 이 추가되어 있음을 확인할 수 있다.<br>\n페이지를 리사이징 하면, –vh값이 바뀌는 것도 확인할 수 있다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 278px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/b786797e1ccccd7010a0f9bb8b1f5f2f/75062/css-vh-01.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 20.3125%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/b786797e1ccccd7010a0f9bb8b1f5f2f/a59e9/css-vh-01.webp 192w,\n/static/b786797e1ccccd7010a0f9bb8b1f5f2f/968d1/css-vh-01.webp 278w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 278px) 100vw, 278px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/b786797e1ccccd7010a0f9bb8b1f5f2f/3b721/css-vh-01.png 192w,\n/static/b786797e1ccccd7010a0f9bb8b1f5f2f/75062/css-vh-01.png 278w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 278px) 100vw, 278px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/b786797e1ccccd7010a0f9bb8b1f5f2f/75062/css-vh-01.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h4 id=\"1-2-css-root에---vh-선언-및-사용\" style=\"position:relative;\">1-2. CSS :root에 –vh 선언 및 사용<a href=\"#1-2-css-root%EC%97%90---vh-%EC%84%A0%EC%96%B8-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9\" aria-label=\"1 2 css root에   vh 선언 및 사용 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">:root</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">--vh</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 100%<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">html, body</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">width</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>100%<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">min-height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token function\">var</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>--vh<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token comment\">/* min-height: calc(var(--vh) * 100); */</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"2-css로-해결\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. CSS로 해결<a href=\"#2-css%EB%A1%9C-%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0\" aria-label=\"2 css로 해결 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>-webkit-fill-available이라는 프로퍼티로 해결할 수 있다.<br>\n적용할 대상에 다음과 같이 CSS를 작성한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">html, body</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">min-height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 100vh<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token property\">min-height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> -webkit-fill-available<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">/* 또는 */</span>\r\n<span class=\"token selector\">html, body</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 100vh<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> -webkit-fill-available<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fill-available<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"2-1-css-supports-문법-기능쿼리-feature-query\" style=\"position:relative;\">2-1. CSS @supports 문법 (기능쿼리, feature query)<a href=\"#2-1-css-supports-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95-%EA%B8%B0%EB%8A%A5%EC%BF%BC%EB%A6%AC-feature-query\" aria-label=\"2 1 css supports 문법 기능쿼리 feature query permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h4>\n<p>문제는 크롬과 같은 지원하지 않는 데스크탑 브라우저들이 있다는 것이다.<br>\n이것을 해결하려면 iOS 환경에서만 적용되도록 해야한다.<br>\n@supports (-webkit-touch-callout: none)을 사용하면 iOS 환경만 선택할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"css\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-css line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-css\"><span class=\"token selector\">.fill-screen</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 100vh<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">width</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 100vw<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token comment\">/* iOS only */</span>\r\n<span class=\"token atrule\"><span class=\"token rule\">@supports</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token property\">-webkit-touch-callout</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> none<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> \r\n  <span class=\"token property\">height</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> -webkit-fill-available<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 768px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/0edaff580752a37c4c793b573a714bab/bbbf7/css-vh-02.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 38.541666666666664%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source\n              srcset=\"/static/0edaff580752a37c4c793b573a714bab/a59e9/css-vh-02.webp 192w,\n/static/0edaff580752a37c4c793b573a714bab/0ca9f/css-vh-02.webp 384w,\n/static/0edaff580752a37c4c793b573a714bab/dc9b9/css-vh-02.webp 768w,\n/static/0edaff580752a37c4c793b573a714bab/e2c2f/css-vh-02.webp 1152w,\n/static/0edaff580752a37c4c793b573a714bab/94b1e/css-vh-02.webp 1280w\"\n              sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n              type=\"image/webp\"\n            />\n          <source\n            srcset=\"/static/0edaff580752a37c4c793b573a714bab/3b721/css-vh-02.png 192w,\n/static/0edaff580752a37c4c793b573a714bab/66595/css-vh-02.png 384w,\n/static/0edaff580752a37c4c793b573a714bab/fe486/css-vh-02.png 768w,\n/static/0edaff580752a37c4c793b573a714bab/d2d74/css-vh-02.png 1152w,\n/static/0edaff580752a37c4c793b573a714bab/bbbf7/css-vh-02.png 1280w\"\n            sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\"\n            type=\"image/png\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n            src=\"/static/0edaff580752a37c4c793b573a714bab/fe486/css-vh-02.png\"\n            alt=\"alt text\"\n            title=\"\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n            decoding=\"async\"\n            style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n  </a>\n    </span>\r\n<em>caniuse.com</em></p>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<h5>참고</h5>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://abcdqbbq.tistory.com/71\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSS Supports, @supports (지원하는 css에 따른 스타일 적용)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://injeblog.tistory.com/110\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">iOS 사파리 100vh 문제 해결법</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://css-tricks.com/the-trick-to-viewport-units-on-mobile/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The trick to viewport units on mobile</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://medium.com/quick-code/100vh-problem-with-ios-safari-92ab23c852a8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">100vh problem with iOS Safari</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dev.to/cydstumpel/4-things-in-web-development-i-ve-learned-in-2020-so-far-3cg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">4 things in web development I’ve learned in 2020, so far</a></li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%EC%9B%90%EC%9D%B8\">원인</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0\">해결</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#1-javascript--css%EB%A1%9C-%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0\">1. Javascript + CSS로 해결</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#1-1-javascript%EB%A1%9C-%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80-%EB%A1%9C%EB%94%A9-%EC%8B%9C%EC%99%80-resize%EB%90%A0%EB%95%8C-%EB%A7%88%EB%8B%A4-%ED%99%94%EB%A9%B4%EC%9D%98-%EB%86%92%EC%9D%B4%EA%B0%92%EC%9D%84-%EC%B2%B4%ED%81%AC%ED%95%98%EC%97%AC-html%EC%97%90---vh%EB%9D%BC%EB%8A%94-style%EC%9D%84-%EC%B6%94%EA%B0%80%ED%95%B4%EC%A4%80%EB%8B%A4\">1-1. Javascript로, 페이지 로딩 시와 resize될때 마다 화면의 높이값을 체크하여 html에 –vh라는 style을 추가해준다.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#1-2-css-root%EC%97%90---vh-%EC%84%A0%EC%96%B8-%EB%B0%8F-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9\">1-2. CSS :root에 –vh 선언 및 사용</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#2-css%EB%A1%9C-%ED%95%B4%EA%B2%B0\">2. CSS로 해결</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#2-1-css-supports-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95-%EA%B8%B0%EB%8A%A5%EC%BF%BC%EB%A6%AC-feature-query\">2-1. CSS @supports 문법 (기능쿼리, feature query)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Sep 29, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"[CSS] 모바일 환경에서의 vh","summary":"프로젝트 진행 중 전체화면을 만들기 위해 100vh를 사용했다. PC환경에서 테스트 할 때에는 문제가 없었지만, 실제 모바일 기기에서 브라우저로 접속 후 확인했더니 세로 스크롤이 생기는 버그가 있었다. vh는 viewport height에 해당하는 단위로, 해당 브라우저의 높이에 따라 상대적으로 적용되는 단위다. 예를 들어, 화면의 높이가 100px이라면 1vh는 1px이 된다.","date":"Nov 17, 2022","categories":["CSS"],"tags":["css","vh"],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/css/vh/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/etc/mvc/","title":"디자인패턴 : MVC"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/css/cursor/","title":"마우스 커서 변경하기"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}